---
layout: base
title: Example Projects
permalink: /portfolio/
description: "Illustrative examples of what each Mobius package covers for a local business. These are hypothetical, not client case studies."
---
{# Each example is a hypothetical. "pkg" is a package id from src/_data/packages.js; the name is looked up so it never drifts. #}
{% set examples = [
  {
    id: "restaurant",
    pkg: "tuneup",
    kind: "Website tune-up for a restaurant",
    situation: "A restaurant's reservation button can't be reached with a keyboard, the menu is a photo with no text, and a screen reader announces the booking form's fields as just \"edit text.\"",
    plan: "We would test the pages guests use most, fix the labels, contrast, link names and menu text, and walk through the reservation flow by keyboard and screen reader. Anything that only the reservation vendor can fix goes to them as a clear written request.",
    result: "The owner ends up with fixes on the site, a before-and-after report to keep on file, and an accessibility statement that matches what is actually true."
  },
  {
    id: "appointments",
    pkg: "sprint",
    kind: "Automation sprint for an appointment business",
    situation: "A salon owner answers new inquiries when there's a gap between clients, sends reminders by hand and has no way to follow up with no-shows or customers who haven't been back in months.",
    plan: "We would set up an instant reply to new inquiries, online booking with confirmations, reminders before each appointment, an automatic offer of a new time after a no-show, review requests and a win-back message.",
    result: "The owner ends up with a follow-up system that runs without anyone remembering to do it, and a written record of what was set up."
  },
  {
    id: "new-shop",
    pkg: "launch",
    kind: "Website launch for a new shop",
    situation: "A shop is about to open with a social media page and nothing else. There's no website, no business email on its own domain, and the Google listing is half filled in.",
    plan: "We would write and build a small site, set up the domain and business email, add a contact form that reaches the owner, and set up the Google Business Profile.",
    result: "The owner ends up with a site built mobile-first and to WCAG 2.1 AA, accounts registered in their own name, and a Google listing they can edit themselves."
  },
  {
    id: "office",
    pkg: "custom",
    kind: "Custom tool for an office",
    situation: "An office retypes the same client details from an intake form into a spreadsheet, then again into the accounting software, and the same few questions arrive by phone every week.",
    plan: "We would scope the problem on a free call, then quote a fixed price in writing. The work could include connecting the intake form to the other systems and an assistant that answers common questions from the office's own documents.",
    result: "The owner ends up with a written fixed quote before any work starts, and if they go ahead, a tool built around how the office already works."
  },
  {
    id: "multi-location",
    pkg: "partner-plus",
    kind: "Ongoing tech partner for a multi-location business",
    situation: "A business with several locations has a different booking tool at each one, hours that don't match online, and a handful of vendors who each blame the others when something breaks.",
    plan: "We would run monthly health checks, make the changes each location needs, plan the next quarter together and deal with the other vendors on the owner's behalf.",
    result: "The owner ends up with one team to call, a monthly report in plain English and a month-to-month plan with no long-term contract."
  },
  {
    id: "not-sure",
    pkg: "checkup",
    kind: "Free checkup for an owner who isn't sure where to start",
    situation: "An owner suspects the website is slow, the booking page is awkward and the Google listing is out of date, but doesn't know which problem matters most or whom to ask.",
    plan: "We would hold a 20-minute call, check the website on mobile and for accessibility, test the booking or contact flow start to finish and review the Google Business Profile.",
    result: "The owner ends up with a written report that ranks the top fixes, and can use it with us, with another vendor, or not at all."
  }
] %}

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Examples</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">Example projects</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-6">Here's what each package looks like in practice, using made-up situations that local businesses commonly run into.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 p-6" role="note" aria-labelledby="examples-note">
      <p id="examples-note" class="font-medium text-gray-900">These are illustrative examples, not client case studies.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-800">Mobius is a new firm and we haven't published any client work yet. Nothing below describes a real business or a real result. We'll publish real projects here, with each client's permission, as they are completed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="examples-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="examples-heading" class="sr-only">Six example projects</h2>
    <ul class="grid list-none gap-6 p-0 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% for ex in examples %}
      <li class="card flex flex-col">
        <p class="eyebrow self-start">Illustrative example</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">{{ ex.kind }}</h3>
        <h4 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">The situation</h4>
        <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">{{ ex.situation }}</p>
        <h4 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">What we would do</h4>
        <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">{{ ex.plan }}</p>
        <h4 class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">What the owner ends up with</h4>
        <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">{{ ex.result }}</p>
        {% for p in packages.all %}{% if p.id == ex.pkg %}
        <p class="mt-6 pt-2">Package: <a class="link font-medium" href="/pricing/#{{ p.id }}">{{ p.name }}<span class="sr-only"> on the packages page</span></a></p>
        {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band-dark on-dark">
  <div class="wrap-narrow text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium text-white md:text-4xl">See what we'd find at your business</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-100">The Free Tech Checkup is a 20-minute call and a written report on your own website, booking flow and Google presence.</p>
    <a class="btn-light mt-8" href="{{ site.writeupCta.href }}">Get my free website write-up</a>
  </div>
</section>
